    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασῡρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whistle,</i> of the wind, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				3.50
			</span></i>; f.l. in Theopomp. Hist.<i><span class="en">
				76
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασυν-σῡρίττω</span></b> , c. acc. metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς φήμης πτερὸν τὴν ὕβριν
					ἁπανταχῇ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					40.59
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>whistle away, waste idly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μέχρι τῆς αὐλῆς</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδόν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>.</div>
